            <li><strong>Liquidité & POI :</strong> Repérez les pièges, les FVG et les Order Blocks institutionnels[span_3](start_span)[span_3](end_span)[span_4](start_span)[span_4](end_span)[span_5](start_span)[span_5](end_span).</li>
